# This repo is worked on from Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites
# checked-out files to CRLF. That is harmless for PHP, but fatal for a shell
# script running on the Linux VPS: bash reads the trailing \r as part of the
# shebang and fails with "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M".
#
# Pin shell scripts to LF so they stay executable wherever they are checked out
# or copied to.
*.sh text eol=lf
